<item><title>Tanzania High Court orders immediate end to X restrictions</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-high-court-orders-immediate-end-to-x-restrictions-7ff25b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-high-court-orders-immediate-end-to-x-restrictions-7ff25b/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The judges ruled that blocking the platform exceeded regulators’ powers and violated users’ constitutional rights.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:39:51 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-high-court-orders-immediate-end-to-x-restrictions-7ff25b/share.jpg" length="41177" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-high-court-orders-immediate-end-to-x-restrictions-7ff25b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>JKCI seeks 25 billion/- for cardiac care at December 4 gala</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/jkci-seeks-25-billion-for-cardiac-care-at-december-4-gala-6ec004/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/jkci-seeks-25-billion-for-cardiac-care-at-december-4-gala-6ec004/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The institute plans to fund heart surgery, build a House of Hope and buy diagnostic equipment for school screening programmes.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:07:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tanzania secures 4.7 billion US dollars in climate investment opportunities</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-secures-4-7-billion-us-dollars-in-climate-48aeca/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-secures-4-7-billion-us-dollars-in-climate-48aeca/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>Of the commitments, the African Development Bank approved 54m US dollars for 70,000 electric stoves for schools and health facilities.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:23:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Dodoma and Aga Khan Foundation launch gender-violence campaign with income programme</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/dodoma-and-aga-khan-foundation-launch-gender-violence-fbf59c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/dodoma-and-aga-khan-foundation-launch-gender-violence-fbf59c/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The Tuinuke Pamoja project pairs community education on gender-based violence with household income activities across seven districts, delivered through 105 local groups.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:23:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Beginnings Fund pledges $85 million for Tanzania maternal care</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/beginnings-fund-pledges-85-million-for-tanzania-maternal-c0e512/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/beginnings-fund-pledges-85-million-for-tanzania-maternal-c0e512/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The five-year partnership allocates $75.4 million to mainland Tanzania and $9.6 million to Zanzibar, with care for women and newborns as its target.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:25:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
